{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32566","headline":"送人登第东归 · 刘驾","name":"送人登第东归","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"学古既到古，反求鉴者难。\n见诗未识君，疑生建安前。\n海畔岂无家，终难成故山。\n得失虽由命，世途多险艰。\n我皇追古风，文柄付大贤。\n此时如爲君，果在甲科间。\n晚达多早贵，举世咸爲然。\n一夕颜却少，虽病心且安。\n所居似清明，冷竈起新烟。\n高情懒行乐，花盛仆马前。\n归程不淹留，指期到田园。\n香醪四邻熟，霜橘千株繁。\n肯忆长安夜，论诗风雪寒。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘驾","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_32566.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32566","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}